    "%@ 开始，仍在运行" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Started %@, still running"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 的还原点会被虚拟 Mac 现在的状态替换，之后无法再回到原来那个状态。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The restore point from %@ will be replaced with the Virtual Mac’s current state. You won’t be able to return to the earlier state."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@。「%@」：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@. “%@”: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@。「%2$@」：%3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@。打开时 macOS 会询问你是否信任它，请确认来源可靠。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@. macOS will ask whether you trust it when you open it; make sure it comes from a source you trust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@可能在等你存储文稿，或者没有响应。可以切过去处理后再退出 MacBox；强制退出会丢失没有存储的内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ may be waiting for you to save changes, or may not be responding. You can switch to it and quit MacBox again later. If you force it to quit, any unsaved changes will be lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@可能都在等你存储文稿，或者没有响应。可以切过去处理后再退出 MacBox；强制退出会丢失没有存储的内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ may be waiting for you to save changes, or may not be responding. You can switch to them and quit MacBox again later. If you force them to quit, any unsaved changes will be lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
