    "App 的主程序「%@」不是可以运行的程序，App 可能已损坏。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app’s executable “%@” isn’t a program that can run. The app may be damaged."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 的主程序是脚本，需要「%@」才能运行，但这台 Mac 上没有它。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app’s executable is a script that needs “%@” to run, but it isn’t on this Mac."
          }
