      }
    },
    "CPU 核心" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU Cores"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacBox" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "MacBox 上次没有正常退出，%@借出的偏好设置没能收回，这台 Mac 上这个应用的设置暂时还是盒子里的内容。详情见它的详情面板；下次打开它或重新打开 MacBox 时会再试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MacBox didn’t quit normally last time, and the preferences lent to %@ couldn’t be returned, so this Mac’s settings for it are still the box’s for now. See the app’s details. MacBox will try again the next time you open it or MacBox."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacBox 上次没有正常退出，%@借出的偏好设置没能收回，这台 Mac 上这些应用的设置暂时还是盒子里的内容。详情见各应用的详情面板；下次打开它们或重新打开 MacBox 时会再试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MacBox didn’t quit normally last time, and the preferences lent to %@ couldn’t be returned, so this Mac’s settings for these apps are still the boxes’ for now. See each app’s details. MacBox will try again the next time you open them or MacBox."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacBox 会把应用装进一个独立的盒子。你照常使用，\n它写下的文件、设置和钥匙串都不会留在你的 Mac 上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MacBox installs the app in its own box. Use it as usual —\nthe files, settings and keychain items it writes never stay on your Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacBox 用下面这个文件确认同一时间只有一个 MacBox 在管理盒子，但它打不开（%@）。为了不和可能正在运行的另一个 MacBox 冲突，这次先不管理盒子。删除这个文件，再重新打开 MacBox 就好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MacBox uses the file below to make sure only one MacBox manages the boxes at a time, but the file can’t be opened (%@). To avoid conflicting with another MacBox that may be running, this one won’t manage the boxes. Delete the file, then open MacBox again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH 代理（ssh-agent）里你的钥匙" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your keys in the SSH agent (ssh-agent)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VPN、代理等网络扩展需要系统级安装。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Network extensions such as VPNs and proxies require a system-wide install."
          }
        }
      }
    },
