    "「%@」上次运行时借出的偏好设置还没有收回，它和这个应用使用同一组偏好设置。请先打开再退出一次「%@」，或者重新打开 MacBox，让 MacBox 收回它的设置。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The preferences “%1$@” used last time haven’t been returned yet, and it shares preferences with this app. Open and quit “%1$@” once, or reopen MacBox, so MacBox can return them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "「%1$@」上次运行时借出的偏好设置还没有收回，它和这个应用使用同一组偏好设置。请先打开再退出一次「%2$@」，或者重新打开 MacBox，让 MacBox 收回它的设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」不是 App 里的普通文件" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” isn’t a regular file in the app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」不是有效的 .%@ 文件。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” isn’t a valid .%@ file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "「%1$@」不是有效的 .%2$@ 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」不是有效的 App" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” is not a valid app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」会从这台 Mac 的偏好设置移进盒子（名字以它开头的也一起），以后只在应用运行时借出，删除盒子时一起删除。\n\n如果它其实属于别的程序，那个程序就读不到它了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” will move from this Mac’s preferences into the box, along with any whose names start with it. From then on it’s lent out only while the app runs, and it’s deleted with the box.\n\nIf it actually belongs to another program, that program won’t see it anymore."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」启动后很快就被信号 %@ 结束了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "「%1$@」启动后很快就被信号 %2$@ 结束了。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” was ended by signal %@ right after opening. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」启动后很快就被信号 %@（%@）结束了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "「%1$@」启动后很快就被信号 %2$@（%3$@）结束了。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” was ended by signal %@ (%@) right after opening. "
