    "「%@」缺少标识符或可执行文件" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” is missing a bundle identifier or executable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」自带苹果沙盒，本机隔离装不下它：套上 MacBox 的沙盒后，它一启动就会被系统结束。它已经被苹果的沙盒关在自己的容器里；要完全隔开，请在详情面板里改用虚拟 Mac。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” uses the App Sandbox, which Native Isolation can’t hold: inside MacBox’s sandbox, macOS ends it as soon as it starts. Apple’s sandbox already confines it to its own container; to wall it off completely, switch it to Virtual Mac in its details."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」设为在虚拟 Mac 中运行，需要先完成下面的一次性设置。" : {
