    "其中 %lld 个可能属于这个应用，删除盒子后会留在这台 Mac 上。可以在完整报告里收进盒子。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld of them may belong to this app and would stay on this Mac after you delete the box. You can move it into the box from the full report."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld of them may belong to this app and would stay on this Mac after you delete the box. You can move them into the box from the full report."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其中有%@里的文件夹：「%@」第一次写入时，macOS 可能会问是否允许它访问%@。这是在问盒子里的这个应用，允许后它才能写入。macOS 会记住这个选择，删除应用后也还在，可以在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 文件与文件夹」里撤销。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Some of these folders are in places macOS protects (%@). The first time “%@” writes there, macOS may ask whether to allow it%@. It’s asking about this app in the box, and the app can write there only once you allow it. macOS remembers the choice even after you delete the app; you can change it in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Files & Folders."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "其中有%1$@里的文件夹：「%2$@」第一次写入时，macOS 可能会问是否允许它访问%3$@。这是在问盒子里的这个应用，允许后它才能写入。macOS 会记住这个选择，删除应用后也还在，可以在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 文件与文件夹」里撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
