    "可能属于这个应用、但写在了盒子外的设置" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Settings Possibly From This App, Written Outside the Box"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可能是它写在盒子外的设置" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Settings it may have written outside the box"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可能需要虚拟 Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "May Need Virtual Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同一时间只能由一个 MacBox 管理盒子：两个一起运行时，会互相结束对方打开的应用、收回对方借出的设置。请使用正在运行的那个。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only one MacBox can manage the boxes at a time. If two ran together, each would quit the apps the other opened and take back the settings the other lent out. Use the one that’s already running."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步状态图标、右键菜单等访达扩展不可用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finder extensions such as sync status badges and context menu items won’t work."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名称" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "后台下载服务" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Background download service"
          }
        }
      }
