    "在线安装器" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Online Installer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在线安装器要联网才能下载安装包，不联网时它装不了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Online installers need the network to download the installer package, so this one can’t install while offline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在聚焦中显示" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show in Spotlight"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在虚拟 Mac 中运行的应用" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apps That Use the Virtual Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在虚拟 Mac 的访达中打开 位置 › My Shared Files › 传入，即可安装。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To install, open Locations › My Shared Files › 传入 in the Virtual Mac’s Finder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在虚拟 Mac 里，这两个文件夹位于 访达 › 位置 › My Shared Files。「传出」里的文件来自虚拟 Mac，会像下载的文件一样加上隔离标记，打开时由 macOS 检查。在「传出」里放行过的应用之后还会再被检查，要长期使用请先把它移出来。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the Virtual Mac, these folders appear as “传入” and “传出” under Finder › Locations › My Shared Files. Files in “传出” come from the Virtual Mac, so they’re quarantined like downloads and checked by macOS when they’re opened. An app you allow to open from “传出” will be checked again later, so move it out of “传出” before using it regularly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在访达中显示" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show in Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在访达中显示应用数据" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show App Data in Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在访达中显示配置文件" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show Configuration File in Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "域名解析（DNS）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Name lookups (DNS)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "声音输出" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sound Output"
          }
        }
      }
