    "复制到虚拟 Mac 的「传入」文件夹" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copy to the Virtual Mac’s “传入” (Incoming) folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外接硬盘、网络磁盘" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "external or network drives"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "好" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果这是一个运行后才下载完整安装包的小安装器，请打开，由 MacBox 接手安装。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If this is a small installer that downloads the full package when it runs, turn this on so MacBox can take over the installation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "存储" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Storage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "存储为 Markdown…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save as Markdown…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "存储为图片…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save as Image…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "存进盒子，从这台 Mac 上删除，以后只在应用运行时借给系统" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save it in the box and remove it from this Mac; from then on it’s lent to the system only while the app runs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它不在那次运行新写下的设置里。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It isn’t among the settings that run newly wrote."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它可以新建、修改、删除「%@」里的文件，删除应用后这些文件仍然保留。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It will be able to create, change and delete files in %@, and they stay after you delete the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它可能在等你存储，也可能没有响应。强制退出会丢失没有存储的内容" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It may be waiting for you to save changes, or it may not be responding. Force quitting loses any unsaved changes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它可能需要这台 Mac 上没有的组件，或者在沙盒里无法运行；可以试试改用虚拟 Mac。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It may need components this Mac doesn’t have, or it may not run in the sandbox. Try running it in Virtual Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它已经被苹果的沙盒关在自己的容器里，读不到你的文稿和其他 App 的数据。本机隔离装不下它：套上 MacBox 的沙盒后，它一启动就会被系统结束。要完全隔开，请改用虚拟 Mac。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple’s sandbox already confines it to its own container, where it can’t read your documents or other apps’ data. Native Isolation can’t hold it: inside MacBox’s sandbox, macOS ends it as soon as it starts. To wall it off completely, use Virtual Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "它的文件夹会移到废纸篓，需要时可以从废纸篓里找回。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Its folder will be moved to the Trash, where you can recover it if needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装包已下载完成，MacBox 正在接手安装…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The installer package has finished downloading. MacBox is taking over the installation…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装包带有安装脚本（通常用于安装后台服务或驱动），MacBox 没有执行它们。功能异常时请改用虚拟 Mac。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The package contains installer scripts (usually for installing background services or drivers), which MacBox didn’t run. If something doesn’t work, switch to Virtual Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装器" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装器已下载「%@」，正在完成安装…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The installer downloaded “%@”. Finishing the installation…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装器没有启动器。安装完成后，启动器会按这里的设置创建。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installers don’t get a launcher. Once the installation finishes, one is created according to this setting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装器自己下载的安装包" : {
