    "应用" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用下载的文件直接保存到你的「下载」文件夹，删除应用后仍然保留；它也能修改、删除那里的文件。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Files the app downloads are saved directly to your Downloads folder and stay there after you delete the app. The app can also change or delete files there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用保存的密码不会写进你的「登录」钥匙串。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Passwords the app saves never go into your “login” keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用只能在盒子里写文件（共享时还有「下载」）。在应用里把下载位置改到别的文件夹之前，先把那个文件夹加到这里。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app can only write inside its box (and to Downloads when shared). Before changing its download location to another folder, add that folder here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用只能看到盒子里自己的「下载」文件夹。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app can only see its own Downloads folder inside the box."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用可以新建、修改、删除这些文件夹里的文件；删除应用、清除数据、还原都不会动它们。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app can create, change and delete files in these folders. Deleting the app, clearing its data or restoring won’t touch them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用和它的全部数据（设置、缓存、钥匙串）会一起移到废纸篓。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app and all its data (settings, caches, keychain) will be moved to the Trash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用和它的全部数据（设置、缓存、钥匙串）会一起移到废纸篓。它存进你「下载」和它可以写入的文件夹里的文件不在盒子里，会保留。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
