    },
    "应用看到的是盒子里的主目录：设置、缓存、登录状态都存在 MacBox 里" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app sees the box as its home folder: settings, caches and sign-ins are stored in MacBox"
