    },
    "应用自己的程序" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app’s own program"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用连不上任何服务器，在本机上的代理也连不上；它显示的网页也打不开，用网页做的界面会是空白。登录、同步、更新都用不了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app can’t reach any server, not even a proxy on this Mac. Web pages it shows won’t load either, so parts built from web pages stay blank. Signing in, syncing and updates won’t work."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用退出后统计。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Counted after the app quits."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用需要安装系统组件（驱动、系统服务、系统扩展等）时，本机隔离会挡住这些操作，软件功能可能不完整。开机自启动被挡住不影响使用，不会提示。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When an app needs to install system components (drivers, system services, system extensions and so on), Native Isolation blocks them and some features may not work. Blocked launch-at-login items don’t affect use and aren’t reported."
          }
        }
      }
