    "虚拟 Mac 还没有设置。第一次需要下载约 18 GB 的 macOS 并安装，之后所有需要它的应用共用一台。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Virtual Mac isn’t set up yet. The first setup downloads and installs about 18 GB of macOS; after that, every app that needs it shares the same one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "虚拟 Mac 里安装的应用和文件会一起移到废纸篓。" : {
      "localizations" : {
