            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apps and files installed in the Virtual Mac will be moved to the Trash along with it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "虚拟硬盘是稀疏文件，只占用实际写入的空间；但虚拟 Mac 里删除的文件不一定会把空间还给本机。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
