      }
    },
    "这个应用上次借出的偏好设置还没收回，为了不丢掉这台 Mac 原来的设置，先不做这个操作。重新打开 MacBox，或者打开再退出一次这个应用后再试。原因：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The preferences this app borrowed last time haven’t been returned yet. To keep this Mac’s original settings safe, MacBox won’t do this until they are. Reopen MacBox, or open and quit the app once, then try again. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个文件夹不能允许写入" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This folder can’t be allowed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台 Mac 上直接安装的「%@」正在运行，它和盒子里的应用使用同一组偏好设置。请先退出它（没有窗口的后台程序可以在「活动监视器」里退出），再打开盒子里的应用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”, installed directly on this Mac, is running and shares preferences with the app in the box. Quit it first (background processes without a window can be quit in Activity Monitor), then open the app in the box."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台 Mac 上装着的「%@」用的也是这组设置。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”, installed on this Mac, uses these settings too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台 Mac 不支持虚拟 Mac 的硬件型号" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Mac doesn’t support the Virtual Mac’s hardware model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台 Mac 不支持该 macOS 镜像（%@），请换一个版本。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Mac doesn’t support this macOS image (%@). Choose a different version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这多半是之前的设置没有完成（中途取消、失败，或者设置时退出了 MacBox）。可以把虚拟 Mac 移到废纸篓，然后重新设置。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This usually means an earlier setup didn’t finish (it was canceled or failed, or MacBox quit during setup). You can move the Virtual Mac to the Trash and set it up again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是 MacBox 存放盒子的地方，不能选。应用本来就能写它自己盒子里的文件夹。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is where MacBox keeps its boxes, so it can’t be chosen. Apps can already write to the folders in their own box."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是整个厂商的名字，收进来会把这个厂商以后所有 App 的设置都算进这个盒子。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It’s a whole vendor’s name, so every app from this vendor would have its settings put in this box."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这次没有自动还原。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The automatic restore was skipped."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这次要打开的%@没有处理，" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not opened: %@. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这次运行不允许联网。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Network access was blocked for this run."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这次运行期间，你真实的偏好设置目录（~/Library/Preferences）里新出现了这些设置，它们不在 MacBox 借出、收回的范围里，删除盒子后仍然留在这台 Mac 上。偏好设置由系统服务替所有程序代写，分不出是谁写的，同一时间别的程序新建的也会列进来。只记设置项的名字，不记内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "During this run, these settings newly appeared in your real preferences folder (~/Library/Preferences). They’re outside what MacBox lends and returns, so they stay on this Mac after you delete the box. A system service writes preferences for every program, so MacBox can’t tell who wrote them; anything another program created at the same time shows up here too. Only the names of the settings are recorded, not their values."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里是系统和你安装的 App，不能选。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This holds the system and the apps you’ve installed, so it can’t be chosen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里有聚焦里的启动器，应用改了它们就能在盒子外运行，不能选。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This holds the Spotlight launchers. An app that changed them could run outside the box, so it can’t be chosen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "进入睡眠失败：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn’t go to sleep: %@"
