        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blocks reading Mail, Messages, Safari, other apps’ data and SSH keys"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "隐藏文件夹里多是配置和凭证，写进去的配置会被你自己的终端和工具执行，不能选。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hidden folders mostly hold settings and credentials, and settings written there would be run by your own terminal and tools, so they can’t be chosen."
          }
